#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:2
msgid "Extending the CLI"
msgstr "扩展 CLI"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:4
msgid ""
"LMCache's CLI is built on a plugin-style architecture that supports "
"**N-level nested subcommands** with zero-registration auto-discovery. "
"This guide explains how to add commands at each level."
msgstr "LMCache 的 CLI 基于插件式架构构建，支持 **N 级嵌套子命令**，并具有零注册自动发现功能。本指南解释了如何在每个级别添加命令。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:9
msgid "Architecture Overview"
msgstr "架构概述"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:11
msgid ""
"The CLI framework is composed of two core classes in "
"``lmcache/cli/commands/base.py``:"
msgstr "CLI 框架由两个核心类组成，位于 ``lmcache/cli/commands/base.py``："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:14
msgid ""
"**BaseCommand** — Abstract base class for leaf commands (commands that "
"perform actual work)."
msgstr "**BaseCommand** — 叶命令的抽象基类（执行实际工作的命令）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:16
msgid ""
"**CompositeCommand** — A ``BaseCommand`` subclass for commands that only "
"group sub-subcommands. It auto-discovers child commands by scanning the "
"package where it is defined."
msgstr "**CompositeCommand** — 一个 ``BaseCommand`` 子类，用于仅将子子命令分组的命令。它通过扫描定义它的包自动发现子命令。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:20
msgid ""
"The discovery mechanism uses ``pkgutil.iter_modules`` to scan direct "
"submodules of a package, then collects all concrete ``BaseCommand`` "
"subclasses found in those modules. This means:"
msgstr "发现机制使用 ``pkgutil.iter_modules`` 扫描包的直接子模块，然后收集在这些模块中找到的所有具体的 ``BaseCommand`` 子类。这意味着："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:24
msgid ""
"Each command is a separate ``.py`` file (or a sub-package with an "
"``__init__.py``)."
msgstr "每个命令都是一个单独的 ``.py`` 文件（或带有 ``__init__.py`` 的子包）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:26
msgid ""
"No manual registration is needed — just create the file and it is picked "
"up automatically."
msgstr "无需手动注册 — 只需创建文件，它会自动被识别。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:28
msgid ""
"Utility/helper modules should be prefixed with ``_`` (e.g. "
"``_helpers.py``) so they are excluded from the scan."
msgstr "工具/辅助模块应以 ``_`` 开头（例如 ``_helpers.py``），以便在扫描时将其排除。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:32
msgid "Auto-Discovery Mechanism"
msgstr "自动发现机制"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:34
msgid ""
"The CLI uses a unified ``discover_subclasses()`` utility (defined in "
"``lmcache/v1/utils/subclass_discovery.py``) to locate command classes at "
"every level.  Understanding the two discovery entry points is key to "
"extending the CLI."
msgstr "CLI 使用统一的 ``discover_subclasses()`` 工具（定义在 ``lmcache/v1/utils/subclass_discovery.py`` 中）来定位每个级别的命令类。理解这两个发现入口是扩展 CLI 的关键。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:40
msgid "Top-Level Command Discovery"
msgstr "顶级命令发现"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:42
msgid ""
"When the CLI starts, ``lmcache/cli/commands/__init__.py`` calls "
"``discover_subclasses()`` on its own package (``lmcache.cli.commands``). "
"This scans all **direct submodules** — both ``.py`` files and sub-"
"packages (via their ``__init__.py``) — and collects every concrete "
"``BaseCommand`` subclass found."
msgstr "当 CLI 启动时，``lmcache/cli/commands/__init__.py`` 在其自身的包（``lmcache.cli.commands``）上调用 ``discover_subclasses()``。这会扫描所有 **直接子模块** — 包括 ``.py`` 文件和子包（通过它们的 ``__init__.py``） — 并收集找到的每个具体的 ``BaseCommand`` 子类。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:62
msgid ""
"The resulting ``ALL_COMMANDS`` list is then registered with the root "
"``argparse`` parser in ``main.py``.  This means any new ``.py`` file (or "
"sub-package) placed under ``lmcache/cli/commands/`` is automatically "
"available as a top-level command — no manual imports or registration "
"needed."
msgstr "生成的 ``ALL_COMMANDS`` 列表随后在 ``main.py`` 中注册到根 ``argparse`` 解析器。这意味着放置在 ``lmcache/cli/commands/`` 下的任何新 ``.py`` 文件（或子包）会自动作为顶级命令可用 — 无需手动导入或注册。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:68
msgid "**Filtering rules for top-level discovery:**"
msgstr "**顶级发现的过滤规则：**"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:70
msgid ""
"The module named ``base`` is explicitly excluded (it defines the abstract"
" base classes, not a command)."
msgstr "名为 ``base`` 的模块被明确排除（它定义了抽象基类，而不是一个命令）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:72
msgid ""
"Modules whose name starts with ``_`` are excluded by the underlying "
"``pkgutil.iter_modules`` convention (they are treated as private)."
msgstr "以 ``_`` 开头的模块根据底层的 ``pkgutil.iter_modules`` 约定被排除（它们被视为私有）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:74
msgid "Only **concrete** subclasses are collected — abstract classes are skipped."
msgstr "仅收集 **具体** 子类 — 抽象类会被跳过。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:76
msgid ""
"Only classes **defined in** the scanned module are collected (re-exports "
"are ignored via ``require_defined_in_module=True``)."
msgstr "仅收集在扫描模块中**定义的**类（通过 ``require_defined_in_module=True`` 忽略重新导出）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:80
msgid "Sub-Command Discovery (CompositeCommand)"
msgstr "子命令发现（CompositeCommand）"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:82
msgid ""
"When a ``CompositeCommand`` registers itself with the parser, its "
"``register()`` method calls ``discover_subclasses()`` on the package "
"where the ``CompositeCommand`` subclass is defined (i.e. its own "
"``__init__.py``'s package)."
msgstr "当 ``CompositeCommand`` 向解析器注册时，它的 ``register()`` 方法会在定义 ``CompositeCommand`` 子类的包上调用 ``discover_subclasses()``（即它自己的 ``__init__.py`` 所在的包）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:103
msgid "**Filtering rules for sub-command discovery:**"
msgstr "**子命令发现的过滤规则：**"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:105
msgid ""
"Modules starting with ``_`` are excluded (use this prefix for helper "
"files like ``_utils.py``)."
msgstr "以 ``_`` 开头的模块会被排除（使用这个前缀来命名像 ``_utils.py`` 这样的辅助文件）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:107
msgid ""
"The ``CompositeCommand`` class itself is skipped to avoid infinite "
"recursion."
msgstr "``CompositeCommand`` 类本身被跳过以避免无限递归。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:109
msgid ""
"Only concrete ``BaseCommand`` subclasses **defined in** the scanned "
"module are collected."
msgstr "仅收集在扫描模块中**定义的**具体 ``BaseCommand`` 子类。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:111
msgid ""
"The scan is **non-recursive** (depth 1 only) — each ``CompositeCommand`` "
"only sees its own package's direct children."
msgstr "扫描是 **非递归** 的（仅深度 1）——每个 ``CompositeCommand`` 仅能看到其所在包的直接子项。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:114
msgid ""
"**How nesting works:** If a child is itself a ``CompositeCommand`` "
"(defined in a sub-package's ``__init__.py``), its own ``register()`` "
"method will in turn scan *its* package for further children.  This "
"creates the recursive nesting without any special configuration."
msgstr "**嵌套如何工作：** 如果一个子命令本身是一个 ``CompositeCommand``（在子包的 ``__init__.py`` 中定义），它自己的 ``register()`` 方法将反过来扫描 *它* 的包以查找更多子命令。这在没有任何特殊配置的情况下创建了递归嵌套。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:138
msgid "Directory Layout"
msgstr "目录结构"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:161
msgid "Key Rules"
msgstr "关键规则"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:163
msgid ""
"A ``CompositeCommand`` subclass **must** be defined in the "
"``__init__.py`` of its package."
msgstr "一个 ``CompositeCommand`` 子类 **必须** 在其包的 ``__init__.py`` 中定义。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:165
msgid ""
"Modules starting with ``_`` are **excluded** from auto-discovery (use "
"this for helpers, utilities, internal logic)."
msgstr "以 ``_`` 开头的模块会被 **排除** 在自动发现之外（用于帮助器、工具、内部逻辑）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:167
msgid ""
"Each leaf command file should contain exactly one concrete "
"``BaseCommand`` subclass."
msgstr "每个叶命令文件应包含一个具体的 ``BaseCommand`` 子类。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/cli.rst:169
msgid ""
"The scan is **non-recursive** — each ``CompositeCommand`` only scans its "
"own package's direct submodules."
msgstr "扫描是 **非递归** 的——每个 ``CompositeCommand`` 仅扫描其自身包的直接子模块。"

